Association StaffProgramAssociation
    documentation 'This association indicates the Staff associated with a program.
    domain entity Staff
        documentation 'The Staff associated with the Program.
    domain entity Program
        documentation 'The Program associated to the Staff.
        with context Program
    date BeginDate
        documentation 'Start date for the association of staff to this program.
        is part of identity
    date EndDate
        documentation 'End date for the association of staff to this program.
        is optional
    bool StudentRecordAccess
        documentation 'Indicator of whether the staff has access to the student records of the program 
                      'per district interpretation of FERPA and other privacy laws, regulations, and 
                      'policies.
        is optional